<title>EGYPT: Egypt seeks one mln tonnes coking coal a year.</title>
<headline>Egypt seeks one mln tonnes coking coal a year.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state company Al Nasr for Coke and Chemicals said on Friday it was seeking a U.S. supplier for one million tonnes of metallurgical coal a year for the four years from 1997 to 2000.</p>
<p>The contract would be for medium volatile coal, delivered C+F to Alexandria or El Dekheila ports or FOB at the port of loading. The price would be revised once a year.</p>
<p>The deadline for prequalification applications from U.S. producers is December 16 and the company will then send the qualifiers an invitation to bid.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Wright +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
